  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The graph shows the variation of the mean translational kinetic energy <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{\\mathrm{k}}\"></span> of the molecules in an ideal gas with the thermodynamic temperature <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> of the gas.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which of the following expressions is equal to the Boltzmann constant <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"k_{\\mathrm{B}}\"></span>, where <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is the gradient of the graph?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}m\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{2}m\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{m}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
